# Both lines go through `scripts/pnpm-invocation.ts` instead of the bare name
# `pnpm`, for the same reason as the commit gate: here the launcher RESOLVES and
# then exits 127, so the bare name turns every push into a hand-built PATH shim.
# No `set -e` here either: husky's shim already runs this file as `sh -e`
# (see `.husky/_/h`), and the resolver exits non-zero on its own, so the build
# gate fails by itself and `test:affected` never runs after it.
node scripts/pnpm-invocation.ts run build
node scripts/pnpm-invocation.ts run test:affected
